{"cells":[{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":["# Day 15 — Project: CLI data tool\n","Build a small command-line script that ingests a CSV, cleans it, and outputs a summary with tests and linting."]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":["## Requirements\n","- Read CSV (pandas), drop NA, convert types.\n","- Output summary stats and save a cleaned CSV.\n","- Provide a CLI (`python tool.py --input data.csv --out out.csv`).\n","- Include pytest tests for core functions.\n","- Pass black/flake8/mypy."]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":["## Hints\n","- Put core logic in functions so tests can import them.\n","- Use argparse or click for CLI.\n","- Keep I/O separate from transforms.\n"]}]}
